<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
  <title>Surf Repository</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="CydiaIcon.png">
  <style>
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background: #c7ced5;
      color: #111;
      font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    a { color: #1765a5; }
    .navbar {
      background: #486d91;
      background: -webkit-linear-gradient(top, #7895b1 0%, #4c7093 50%, #345a7e 51%, #2f5273 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1e3f5c;
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .35), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 43px;
      min-height: 43px;
      text-align: center;
      text-shadow: 0 -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .55);
    }
    .page {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 520px;
      padding: 18px 10px 30px;
    }
    .package {
      display: table;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .package-icon, .package-info {
      display: table-cell;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .package-icon { width: 68px; }
    .package-icon img {
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
      display: block;
      height: 57px;
      width: 57px;
    }
    .package-name {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0 0 3px;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
    }
    .package-meta, .package-description {
      color: #4b535b;
      margin: 0;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .55);
    }
    .package-description { margin-top: 3px; }
    .section-title {
      color: #4f5963;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 17px 11px 5px;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .group {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #9da4aa;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .55);
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .row {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #c8c8c8;
      min-height: 43px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .row a {
      color: #111;
      display: block;
      font-size: 16px;
      min-height: 21px;
      padding: 11px 34px 11px 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .row a:active { background: #d9e7f4; }
    .row a:after {
      color: #7d858c;
      content: "\203a";
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      line-height: 20px;
      position: absolute;
      right: 12px;
      top: 11px;
    }
    .row-detail {
      color: #6b7176;
      float: right;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 2px 2px 0 10px;
    }
    .source {
      color: #20262b;
      font-family: Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 13px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: table;
      min-height: 43px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .info-label, .info-value {
      display: table-cell;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .info-label { width: 90px; }
    .info-value {
      color: #646b71;
      text-align: right;
    }
    .note {
      color: #4d555c;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin: 7px 11px 0;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .65);
    }
    .checksum {
      font-family: Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
      .page { padding-top: 28px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar">Surf Repository</div>

  <div class="page">
    <div class="package">
      <div class="package-icon"><img src="CydiaIcon.png" alt="Surf icon"></div>
      <div class="package-info">
        <p class="package-name">Surf</p>
        <p class="package-meta">Version @PACKAGE_VERSION@ &middot; iOS 6+</p>
        <p class="package-description">Package source for the Surf iOS client.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="section-title">Install</p>
    <ul class="group">
      <li class="row"><a href="cydia://url/https://cydia.saurik.com/api/share#?source=https://seg6.space/surf/">Open in Cydia<span class="row-detail">iOS 6&ndash;10</span></a></li>
      <li class="row"><a href="sileo://source/https://seg6.space/surf/">Open in Sileo<span class="row-detail">newer iOS</span></a></li>
      <li class="row"><a href="@PACKAGE_PATH@">Download .deb</a></li>
    </ul>

    <p class="section-title">Source address</p>
    <div class="group"><div class="source">https://seg6.space/surf/</div></div>
    <p class="note">In Cydia, open Sources, tap Edit, then Add. Paste the address above and install Surf.</p>

    <p class="section-title">Requirements</p>
    <div class="group">
      <div class="row info-row"><span class="info-label">Device</span><span class="info-value">iOS 6.0&ndash;14.8.1, rootful</span></div>
      <div class="row info-row"><span class="info-label">Computer</span><span class="info-value">64-bit Windows, macOS, or Linux</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">After installation, run Surf on the computer, choose Pair device, and scan the QR code.</p>

    <p class="section-title">Links</p>
    <ul class="group">
      <li class="row"><a href="https://github.com/seg6/surf/releases/latest">Computer downloads</a></li>
      <li class="row"><a href="https://github.com/seg6/surf">Source code and setup</a></li>
      <li class="row"><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seg6_">Support Surf on Ko-fi</a></li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">Package size: @PACKAGE_SIZE@ bytes.</p>
    <p class="note checksum">SHA-256: @PACKAGE_SHA256@</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
